cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "stockout: retail demand forecasting scored by the replenishment decision"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Tejas
    family-names: Deshmane
    email: tejasdeshmane66@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/Surge77/stockout"
url: "https://github.com/Surge77/stockout"
abstract: >-
  A retail demand forecasting pipeline validated by rolling-origin backtesting, in which
  temporal leakage is enforced by the test suite rather than by convention, and forecasts
  are evaluated by the replenishment decision they drive rather than by percentage error
  alone. The target service level is derived from the newsvendor critical ratio instead of
  being tuned.
keywords:
  - time-series
  - forecasting
  - demand-forecasting
  - backtesting
  - inventory
  - retail
license: MIT
